<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK MAR DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.89 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK MAR DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.89 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 5.89 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for March 20		   13,600</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for March	    6,327</p>
<p> Average reserves to March 17			 6,693</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    5,888</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
